item.description:
Intro As Artificial Intelligence expands and continues to get more and more involved in aspects of daily life, it is only a matter of time until it gets involved in mainstream news feeds&hellip; so I sped things up and did it myself.
Introducing The Neural Times, your &ldquo;Only source of news, curated daily&rdquo;
The Neural Times is uses locally run Large Language Models (LLMs) and locally run Stable Diffusion (for image generation) to create satirical takes on current events worldwide.
